      "description": "Watch Colorado Springs vs Charleston Battery highlights and goals from USL Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 25, 2026. The USL Championship brought intense action to the pitch on July 25, 2026, as Colorado Springs hosted Charleston Battery . Both sides looked to assert their dominance in a clash that promised tactical intrigue and high energy. The Second Half Breakthrough After a tightly contested opening period where both defenses held firm, the match truly came alive after the interval. Colorado Springs began to exert more pressure and were rewarded in the 56th minute. A. Perez found the back of the net, finishing clinically to make it 1-0 and send the home fans into raptures. The goal forced Charleston Battery to become more adventurous, leading to a more open and physical contest, highlighted by a yellow card for I. Foster in the 78th minute. Late Response and Stoppage Time Drama The visitors' persistence paid off in the 81st minute. Following a well-constructed move, J. Kelly turned provider for A. Cabrera , who made no mistake in leveling the score at 1-1. With momentum swinging, Charleston Battery looked to hold on, though the tension rose as K. Pakhomov picked up a booking in the 85th minute. Just as it seemed the points would be shared, individual brilliance decided the encounter deep in stoppage time. In the 95th minute, S. Echevarria found J. Fjeldberg , who slotted home a dramatic winner for Colorado Springs . There was just enough time for another yellow card for Charleston’s M. Foster , but the 2-1 scoreline remained intact, securing a vital three points for the hosts in a breathless finish."
